  LeanVM.Guest.Memory.GuestCntB

  The guest's static certificates counting `blake2s` instructions (`B2C.pathMax · .blake2s`), checked
  (`kwb_checked`), and the weight bounds they give (`kwb_weightLe`, `kwb_weight_le_of_stat`,
  `kwb_weight_le_of_loop`). Generated by `~/fv-handoff/agents/k4-tools/genweights.py`.
-/

module

public import LeanVM.Guest.Memory.GuestCntB.All
